 p=ROOT/'course-resources.html';s=p.read_text().replace('Assignment 1 uses the existing 4-point decision rubric. Assignment 2 retains its 5-point measurement rubric. Assignments 3–9 use five criteria and four performance levels (1, 0.75, 0.5, 0 per criterion), with a chapter-specific artifact.','Assignment 1 retains 4 points; Assignments 2–9 retain 5 points. All current rubrics use four performance levels (1, 0.75, 0.5, 0 per criterion). Source application and transfer reasoning are included within these totals.').replace('Executable test implementation and the separate Code Coverage topic are not established by this release.','Chapters 16 and 17 add student-authored executable test cases in small deterministic teaching models. Broader testing-strategy implementation and the separate Code Coverage topic remain incomplete.').replace('Partial: 11, 12, 13, 16, 17','Partial: 11, 12, 13, 16, 17')
 p.write_text(s)
 # Keep an explicit recovery route after entering an ID and acknowledging the sequence.
